        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Marie Curie</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1867 CE – 1934 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">7 November 1867 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/warsaw">Warsaw</a>, capital of Congress <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poland">Poland</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a>, as Maria Salomea Skłodowska, youngest of five children of the teachers Władysław Skłodowski and Bronisława (née Boguska)</span></div>
